# dockerd is socket-activated in this image (see bake/user-data.in). The bake
# disables docker.service and containerd.service, but `cloud-init clean
# --machine-id` makes every session's boot a systemd *first boot*, which runs
# `preset-all` — and Ubuntu's presets enable everything. This file keeps that
# from turning dockerd back on at boot.
disable docker.service
disable containerd.service
enable docker.socket
